WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Sit and cross the shins comfortably, each foot under the opposite knee.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Lift the hips onto a cushion so the knees rest below the hips.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Stack the spine tall, shoulders relaxed, hands on knees.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Soften the gaze or close the eyes and breathe.
